    "body": "Here is the video what happens:\r\nhttps://asciinema.org/a/FV5oaHyzL2dCCpg4TX7WVcPq9\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n➜ starship timings  \r\n\r\n Here are the timings of modules in your prompt (>=1ms or output):\r\n terraform   -  792ms  -   🏎💨 v0.14.3 default \r\n kubernetes  -    5ms  -   on ☸ versuspoker-dev-eks (development) \r\n git_status  -    3ms  -   [?] \r\n username    -    3ms  -   \r\n directory   -    1ms  -   terraform \r\n git_branch  -   <1ms  -   on 🌱 master \r\n line_break  -   <1ms  -   \\n\r\n character   -   <1ms  -   ➜ \r\n```\r\n",
