    "body": "hi @andytom thanks for the explanation. Doing additional requests to see if there is a new version of the terraform is available seems like overkill. I am using **tfenv** (similar concept to pyenv supported by starship) and switch between different projects where tf version is slightly different, every time I start a new project - I use a new version of TF. \r\n\r\n",
